claim claim_63757272656e745f636c61696d {
  statement "For PS-DIAG/1 with Alarm=true and HeartbeatLost=true, a faithful complete computation in the pinned pgmpy 1.1.2 runtime yields Fault=faulty posterior 152/201 exceeding 0.75 with positive evidence normalizer 201/10000.\nQualifier: Conditional on the unchanged selected-run predicates, exact model and rational assessments, native host correspondence, actual implementation/mapping/substitution qualification and formal-premise assessments within the original 86400-second limit. The fractions 152/201 and 201/10000 denote exact mathematical references. Returned probabilities use the authored uniform 15-significant-digit decimal representation and must agree with those selected-case references within the existing absolute 1e-12 reference bound.\nEngineering scope: {\"system_boundary\":\"The stipulated three-node model and one reusable finite_bayes_diagnosis/1 operation under the operator-authorised native binding.\",\"configuration\":\"PS-DIAG/1 uses Fault->Alarm and Fault->HeartbeatLost with binary state order [0,1] and healthy-before-faulty parent columns. Parameters are p_fault=0.02, p_alarm_given_fault=0.95, p_alarm_given_healthy=0.05, p_loss_given_fault=0.8 and p_loss_given_healthy=0.1. The prepared image is sha256:5d317440653dd5a188223baff22644397cc2a1bd071183a12e9c4cb2f3688f7f with pgmpy 1.1.2.\",\"operating_conditions\":\"The selected run uses Alarm=true and HeartbeatLost=true with exact finite inference and no data fitting or sampling. Qualification uses separately identified contrasting and invalid inputs.\",\"units\":\"All masses and posterior probabilities have unit 1. Completion predicates are boolean and ages are seconds.\",\"time_horizon\":\"This immutable controlled-model investigation accepts executions and actual assessments at maximum age 86400 seconds while preserving their original clocks.\",\"consequences\":\"Acceptance establishes only the requested controlled-model computation. Incorrect acceptance would misstate the conditional probability or whether the prescribed library calculation was performed.\"}"
  environment engarg_case
}

